  explanation:
    en: Zenek Martyniuk's hit song. Even if you hate Disco Polo, you know the lyrics.
      It is unavoidable.
    native: Hit Zenka Martyniuka. Nawet jak nienawidzisz Disco Polo, znasz tekst.
